28: interface TransactionEvent {
29:   type: 'UPSERT_SONG' | 'DELETE_SONG' | 'UPDATE_TIMESTAMPS';
30:   payload: any;
31:   timestamp: string;
32: }
33: ```
34: 
35: ### 3.2 Enhanced LRC JSON (Word-Level Timing)
