37: interface WordTiming {
38:   text: string;
39:   start: number; // Seconds
40:   end: number;   // Seconds
41: }
42: 
43: interface LyricLine {
44:   lineIndex: number;
45:   start: number;
46:   end: number;
47:   chord?: string; // e.g. "rem" or "sim-Capo"
48:   words: WordTiming[];
49: }
50: 
51: interface SongKaraokeTrack {
52:   id: string; // Drive File ID
53:   driveMd5Checksum: string;
54:   youtubeVideoId?: string;
55:   lines: LyricLine[];
56: }
57: ```
58: 
59: ## 4. Security & Quota Architecture
60: - **Zip Slip Guard**: `src/server/ingestion/docx.ts` will strictly process `word/document.xml` in-memory. No file writes to disk during extraction.
61: - **Decompression Bomb Guard**: `stream.pipeline` limits read bytes to 5MB.
62: - **YouTube Quota**: Caching mapped `youtubeVideoId`s in `data.jsonl` prevents re-searching the same song twice. Searches only happen for new or updated drive files.
